          ],
          "content": "Let us explore materials further."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.123,
            0.511,
            0.148
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "6.2 How to Group Materials?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.165,
            0.39,
            0.188
          ],
          "content": "**Activity 6.2: Let us group**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.198,
            0.744,
            0.261
          ],
          "content": " Group the objects shown in Fig. 6.1 based on any common property, such as shape, colour, hardness, softness, shine, dullness or materials they are made up of."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.271,
            0.732,
            0.589
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_2_image_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.321,
            0.595,
            0.539,
            0.615
          ],
          "content": "Fig. 6.1: Objects around us"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.621,
            0.743,
            0.663
          ],
          "content": "Which property did you use to group the objects in Activity 6.2?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.666,
            0.743,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": " Did your friends group objects based on similar properties?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.71,
            0.565,
            0.731
          ],
          "content": "What did you learn from this activity?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.736,
            0.743,
            0.797
          ],
          "content": "You must have noticed that an object can be made from different materials and some materials can be used to make more than one object."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.798,
            0.743,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": "The method of arranging the objects into groups is called **classification**. Objects can be classified on the basis of a common property that they have."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.859,
            0.743,
            0.901
          ],
          "content": "Similarly, we can classify materials based on certain properties."
        },
        {
          "type": "aside_text",
          "bbox": [
